codex
All eight sites are reachable through installed handlers; I haven’t found an uninstalled or wholly unreachable site. IQ80321 and Iyonix install CP6, and both default CPUs carry the flag that installs CP14. The current gate’s default ARM machines do not install either handler.

The CPU fault path is available: neighbouring `arm_cdp()` calls `arm_exception(cpu, ARM_EXCEPTION_UND)`. None of these eight sites does. The two unknown-operation exits look like the smallest refusal fixes because they occur before register writes.

